			"Message": "docs(Rest): Update Documentation/Rust submodule reference\n\nBump the Documentation/Rust submodule pointer from 337d6459e1925a9f014758421ae5ad8c8e0ac7b8 to 1a6bc5f8e32127e1fea796815e9bae5b8c750673 to incorporate upstream Rust API documentation changes.\n\nThis ensures the Rest bundle carries the latest generated documentation artifacts without manual intervention.",
