			],
			"Message": "build(Rest): Update Content-Security-Policy frame-ancestors to land.playform.cloud\n\nThe Content-Security-Policy `frame-ancestors` directive in `doc/_headers` still referenced `editor.land` and `*.editor.land`. Update to `https://land.playform.cloud` and `https://*.land.playform.cloud` to align with the active domain migration away from the grace-hold editor.land.\n\nThis ensures the Rust API documentation can be embedded in the active domain context while maintaining compatibility with all subdomains under land.playform.cloud.",
